TextPosition  OFF
Bendradius DISTANCE

if (!!ce.type eq 'PSPOOL') then
  !note = !!ce.:note
  handle any
    !note = ''
  endhandle
  TextPosition '*Note: $!note' X 15 Y 15 CharHeight 4mm
endif

-- fix : SI59710
TextPosition DetailPlots Corner TL  X 25mm Y 80mm CharHeight 2.1mm Direction  RIGHT Stack 20 Direction  UP  Scale 100
SymbolFile "%pdmsEXE%\iso_symbols/mds-skeys" READONL
handle ANY
endhandle

Itemcode  Length SHORT
Tapping Scale  100
Tapping Dimensions ON
